    """Drive tui.main() through a scripted sequence of loop iterations.

    ready_flags: one bool per loop iteration (was stdin readable?)
    chars: characters returned by stdin.read, in order
    times: value returned by time.monotonic, one per loop iteration
    Returns the fake engine so callers can inspect the recorded calls.
    """
